cutlog NOTICE
=============

cutlog is an unofficial patch bundle for the setlog Android app. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or authored by setlog or its developers.

cutlog is a distinct project that is compatible with the Morphe patching
system. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or authored by Morphe.

