Third-party components
======================

The patch bundle includes the following components. Their licenses apply to
the respective files.

AndroidX Media3 1.11.1 and its runtime dependencies
---------------------------------------------------

The extension bundles AndroidX Media3 (transformer, effect, exoplayer) and its
runtime dependencies (including Guava, Kotlin standard library and kotlinx),
relocated under the dev.utaa.cutlog.shaded package. The GLSL shaders in
patches/src/main/resources/cutlog/media3-shaders/ are taken from the Media3
1.11.1 AAR.

